  "ruleText": "Gal 305.01 Training Requirements All training for Court Appointed Special Advocates of New Hampshire (CASA) shall meet the requirements for licensure pursuant to Gal 300, Gal 400, and Gal 500, as established by the Board.\n\nSource. #14363, eff 11-2-25, EXPIRES: 11-2-35\n\nAPPENDIX",
